<title>USA: KCBT DELIVERABLE HRW WHEAT STOCKS.</title>
<headline>KCBT DELIVERABLE HRW WHEAT STOCKS.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, MO 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kansas City Board of Trade reported stocks of hard red winter wheat in deliverable position in exchange approved warehouses as of Aug 8, in 000 bushels. Note: Deliverable and non-deliverable grades exclude CCC stocks.</p>
